(f) references to an Act is a reference to an Act of the Commonwealth of Australia, or State or 
Territory of Australia, and includes a reference to any regulations or other subordinate 
legislation made under the Act; and 
(g) references to an Act or any Rules is a reference to that Act or Rules as amended or 
