variations, amendments or novations of that agreement or deed. 
2 Contractor’s Obligations 
2.1 The Contractor agrees to perform (and ensure that the Contractor’s Personnel perform) the Services: 
(a) in accordance with the terms and conditions of this Agreement during the Term; 
(b) diligently, competently and with due care and skill; 
(c) behaving ethically in all aspects of its business; 
(d) in a prompt and timely manner; 
(e) in compliance with all laws including legislation and regulations; 
(f) in a manner that is safe to both people and the environment assessed against the higher of 
industry best practice and legislative requirements; 
(g) in compliance with ASC Shipbuilding’s Policies, procedures, practices and any reasonable 
directions and requirements of ASC Shipbuilding as notified by ASC Shipbuilding to the 
Contractor or the Contractor’s Personnel where the Services are being performed or partly 
performed at ASC
